[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Don't be So Sure!]
[00:00.86]Lesson 131 | 第131课
[00:03.19]Don't be so sure! | 别那么肯定！
[00:06.94]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:12.92]What's the problem about deciding on a holiday? | 决定度假有什么问题？
[00:18.48]Where are you going to spend your holidays this year, Gary? | 盖瑞，今年你打算去哪儿度假？
[00:25.29]We may go abroad. | 我们可能会出国。
[00:28.24]I'm not sure. | 我不确定。
[00:30.64]My wife wants to go to Egypt. | 我妻子想去埃及。
[00:34.27]I'd like to go there, too. | 我也想去那儿。
[00:37.40]We can't make up our minds. | 我们拿不定主意。
[00:41.20]Will you travel by sea or by air? | 你们是坐船去还是坐飞机去？
[00:45.96]We may travel by sea. | 我们可能会坐船去。
[00:48.47]It's cheaper, isn't it? | 坐船便宜些，不是吗？
[00:51.54]It may be cheaper, but it takes a long time. | 也许便宜些，但要花很多时间。
[00:56.35]I'm sure you'll enjoy yourselves. | 我相信你们会玩得开心的。
[01:00.04]Don't be so sure. | 别那么肯定。
[01:02.27]We might not go anywhere. | 我们可能哪儿都去不了。
[01:04.86]My wife always worries too much. | 我妻子总是忧虑太多。
[01:08.70]Who's going to look after the dog? | 谁来照看狗呢？
[01:12.03]Who's going to look after the house? | 谁来照看房子呢？
[01:15.86]Who's going to look after the garden? | 谁来照看花园呢？
[01:19.42]We have this problem every year. | 我们每年都有这个问题。
[01:22.80]In the end, we stay at home and look after everything! | 结果，我们待在家里照看一切！